ed to see  the amount of food shaoxing can eat  alone but it doesn't bother han in the  least he has never had a problem with  her weight and always tells her she is  beautiful one day the friends go  shopping for clothes buying clothes has  always been difficult for shashi as an  overweight woman she tries on a white  dress that tears down the neckline  because of her size she embarrassingly  has to buy it because of the damage on  their way back home han asks her what  she wants for her birthday but xiao she  jokes that she wants a handsome man to  date her after the two separate shaushi  finds an abandoned rabbit on the road  she feels bad for it and brings it home  but fails to notice that its eyes are  glowing the following morning a crew of  people knock at her door wanting to  shoot in the studio because of a last  minute change she allows them after  finding out that the model of the shoot  is her celebrity crush huang ki the  entire shoot feels like a dream to her  later huang ki tells her that she has  pretty eyes and could be a model if she  loses weight but then she overhears his  assistant calling her ugly asking him to  stay away from people like her for the  sake of his image starting the next day  she wraps her legs with plastic eats  healthily takes supplements and  exercises harder than ever but after two  weeks of hard work she barely loses one  kilogram that night she accidentally  breaks the sofa with her weight and  falls flat on the floor as she lies  there hopelessly she notices the rabbit  moving around almost as though it is  leading her somewhere she follows the  animal and reaches an abandoned mansion  in the neighborhood when she enters the  house the floor swallows her into a  colorful upside down room shaoxi panics  and tries to move but gravity doesn't  seem to work in this room then an old  man appears in front of her asking her  to make a wish initially shaoshi freaks  out and tries to run away but the lack  of gravity only makes her float when she  calms down the man gives her a blue  potion called the dream fixer it is  supposed to make her dream come true in  an instant although skeptical at first  shaoshi takes a gulp of it and goes to  bed when she wakes up the next morning  she can almost not recognize herself in  the mirror her body has shrunk  significantly making her slim for a few  minutes she lays on the bed trying to  take everything in then she gets a call  from her friend asking her to bring the  pictures from the last photo shoot to  funky's assistant when none of her  clothes fit shaoxi wears the one that  she had to buy because of the damage on  her way to huanke's hotel the people she  knew before do not recognize her while  the bypassers turn around to admire her  beauty similarly hunky is also smitten  by her he comments that he has seen her  before but doesn't know where  suddenly shashi's chest starts getting  bigger followed by her back realizing  that she is turning back into her older  self she runs away without an  explanation at night she again takes the  potion and by the morning she gets  skinny for the second time han arrives  at the house worried because she hasn't  picked up her phone for an entire day he  barges in to see her wearing a headscarf  initially she pretends to be shaoxi's  friend to avoid having to explain the  situation but han recognizes her  instantly he had never seen her as less  beautiful because of her weight so even  though she is significantly thinner he  doesn't notice much difference shaoxie  tells him about the potion and what it  does to the human body han doesn't want  to believe it but the result is right in  front of him minutes later she yet again  turns fat and finds out that the effect  of the potion only lasts for 10 hours  han doesn't like that she's changing her  body unnaturally he also feels jealous  of the actor huang ki knowing that she  took the potion to impress him han's  assistant who is in the fashion industry  takes it upon himself to give shaushi a  makeover after a week of trying out  different hairstyles and facials xiaoshi  turns into a beautiful young woman a  complete contrast from how she was prior  meanwhile han hires swanky to model for  his next music video on the set huanki  claims that he doesn't feel the  chemistry with the female lead and wants  someone who is prettier offended the  female lead quits and storms off the set  just then xiaoshi arrives looking more  stunning than ever hwang ki suggests  they use her as the model since she has  the body and the face for it initially  han doesn't approve of this but when the  director supports the idea he has no  choice but to agree for the next week  the team meets every day for the shoot  shaushi fangirls over huang ki making  han jealous he takes his frustration out  by pointing out little flaws in huanki's  acting and making him take several shots  an unsaid rivalry is established between  the guys one day the director adds a  kissing scene to the script han is  absolutely against the idea so instead  he makes them cover their faces with an  umbrella to make it look like they are  kissing the following day huanki invites  shaoxi out on a date they go to the  movies but notice that han is right  behind their seat when asked what he is  doing there he claims that it is only a  coincidence everywhere the couple goes  he follows them acting like he is going  the same way even when they book a  private cabin at a restaurant he stands  by the door to keep an eye on them when  it starts to get dark xiaoshi wants to  return home but huanki insists she come  to a party with his friends a few  minutes into meeting his friend group  her fingers begin to swell followed by  her entire arm she rushes to the  bathroom and hides inside a stall crying  hysterically outside huanki and his  friends are waiting for her leaving her  no way to escape just when the truth is  about to be outed han comes to save her  in a mascot costume he 