 to gain weight wanky replies that  they should talk about positive things  like her upcoming acting career it is  clear to her that he won't think twice  before leaving her if he sees her real  self after dinner she goes to the old  mansion yet again and asks the miracle  man for a permanent potion he gives her  the potion but warns her that it will  cause a side effect on her life that she  might not like blinded by her need to be  huanky's girlfriend xiaoshi takes the  potion at the same time hans starts to  lose his memories of her he only  remembers that she was someone he used  to know in his childhood the next day is  the release day of the music video  cheshie walks into a hall for a press  conference when she notices the crew  looking at her differently she tries  talking to hwang he but he ignores her  when they are surrounded by the  reporters she finds out that the rumor  of her getting liposuction has  circulated on the internet since being  seen with her is not a good pr move for  huanki he announces that he is in a  relationship with someone else some fans  in the crowd throw their drinks at  xiaoshi for lying about her beauty han  saves her from the media and brings her  upstairs xiao xi soon realizes that he  only remembers the overweight xiaoshi  and thinks that he hasn't met her for a  while she tries to show him their  pictures together but her face is  missing in all of them she breaks down  crying but han just thinks she's in  shock from what happened earlier a week  later huanki comes to her house she  welcomes him in expecting him to  apologize but he asks her to convince  han to sell him a song on finding out he  just wants to use her for her influence  she asks him to get out following the  encounter shaoxi rushes to his office  and finds a picture of them from high  school she finally realizes that she  never stopped loving han and has been  suppressing her feelings until now after  that she goes to the abandoned house  once again this time to ask the man to  send her back to her normal self the man  gives her one last chance and allows her  to transform after turning fat again  shaoxi runs to the playground and meets  han when he calls her by her name she  breaks down crying relieved that he  remembers her one year later the couple  is at their favorite street side  restaurant by now shaoshi has become fit  while han has gained a significant  amount of weight the movie ends as she  tells him that she loves him either way  subscribe for more videos like this turn  on notifications and leave a like to  help the channel out thank you for  watching

